# tab_headline_full

**Claim carried:** C2/C4: width, coverage with Wilson CI and paired ratio to PPI++ for every T1 arm at each headline n.

**Shows:** one block per dataset; bold = shortest valid width (floor excluded); dagger = coverage fails the win rule; the last column is the paired ratio to PPI++ with the tuning left unclipped (the PPI++ row of the same name; `--` where the file has none, e.g. the floor).

**How to read:** read the ratio column against 1 and the coverage column against the nominal level.

